          "indent": 0,
          "line_start": 5,
          "page_start": 1,
          "page_end": 1,
          "text": "(2) Notwithstanding anything contained in sub-section (1), no allowance shall be made in respect of any expenditure incurred by an assessee on advertisement in any souvenir, brochure, tract, pamphlet or the like published by a political party.",
