          "page_end": 1,
          "text": "(a) Any expenditure incurred by an assessee on activities relating to corporate social responsibility referred to in section 135 of the Companies Act, 2013 shall not be deemed to be an expenditure incurred by the assessee for the purposes of the business or profession.",
